Follow [RULES.md](../../RULES.md), [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)
and [DESIGN.md](../../docs/DESIGN.md). Reuse typed feature API modules and existing
components/dependencies. Every ordinary project tab uses ProjectTabShell; Paper
keeps its independent full-width workspace.

Preserve drafts, revision conflicts, keyboard behavior and stale-request guards.
Provide loading/empty/error/read-only/unavailable states and truthful status.
Never place secret/server credentials in VITE_ variables or UI code. Frontend
permission checks complement backend enforcement; they do not replace it.
